   "description": "Add a local concern to a partnership meeting's agenda and open it for discussion; this can take meeting time but does not require anyone to agree or change stance.",
   "compiled": false
  },
  {
   "kind": "reopen-activation-issue",
   "description": "Reopen the activation issue in the institutional agenda for consideration of a local concern, without changing technical validation, public positions, assent, or hold.",
   "compiled": false
  },
