ting occurrence count represents that discussion was opened","active information report represents the concern source"]},{"schema_version":"world-substrate-action-mechanic/v0","mechanic_id":"reopen-activation-issue","version":"1.0","action_kind":"reopen-activation-issue","rationale":"Reopening is represented as an institutional review entry on the activation decision. The action changes only that review entry and leaves technical validation, public positions, assent, and hold untouched.","actor_selector":{"categories":["actor","member"],"components":["member","location"]},"participants":{"activation_decision":{"categories":["validation-decision"],"components":["validation_decision","location"]},"concern_source":{"categories":["information"],"components":["information","location"]}},"parameters":{},"checks":[{"label":"the activation issue is where the representative is","left":{"participant":{"name":"activation_decision","path":"location.location_id"}},"op":"eq","right":{"participant":{"name":"actor","path":"location.location_id"}}},{"label":"the concern is where the representative is","left":{"participant":{"name":"concern_source","path":"location.location_id"}},"op":"eq","right":{"participant":{"name":"actor","path":"location.location_id"}}},{"label":"the concern report is active","left":{"participant":{"name":"concern_source","path":"components.information.active"}},"op":"eq","right":{"literal":true}},{"label":"the issue is not already marked reopened","left":{"participant":{"name":"activation_decision","path":"components.validation_decision.review"}},"op":"ne","right":{"literal":"reopened for local concern"}}],"effects":[{"participant":"activation_decision","path":"components.validation_decision.review","op":"set","value":{"literal":"reopened for local concern"}}],"limits":["The available review field does not retain which concern prompted reopening.","This does not change technical validation, public positions, recorded assent, or hold."],"tests":["An active concern at the activation issue's location marks its review as reopened for a local concern.","An inactive concern report is refused.","A decision already carrying this review entry is refused rather than making a no-op change.","A concern or decision at a different location is refused."],"semantic_bindings":["validation_decision.review represents the institutional review entry","active information report represents the local concern"]},{"schema_version":"world-substrate-action-mechanic/v0","mechanic_id":"attach-condition-to-support","version":"1.0","action_kind":"attach-condition-to-support","rationale":"The supplied condition text is recorded in the activation decision's institutional review field, the available string record. This leaves the technical condition, actor stance, and recorded assent unchanged; the represented state has no separate condition-text record or link to the acting member's position.","actor_selector":{"categories":["actor","member"],"components":["member","location"]},"participants":{"activation_decision":{"categories":["validation-decision"],"components":["validation_decision","location"]},"concern_source":{"categories":["information"],"components":["information","location"]}},"parameters":{"condition":["condition text supplied in the action"]},"checks":[{"label":"the activation issue is where the representative is","left":{"participant":{"name":"activation_decision","path":"location.location_id"}},"op":"eq","right":{"participant":{"name":"actor","path":"location.location_id"}}},{"label":"the concern is where the representative is","left":{"participant":{"name":"concern_source","path":"location.location_id"}},"op":"eq","right":{"participant":{"name":"actor","path":"location.location_id"}}},{"label":"the concern report is active","left":{"participant":{"name":"concern_source","path":"components.information.active"}},"op":"eq","right":{"literal":true}},{"label":"the condition text is not empty","left":{"action_field":"condition"},"op":"ne","right":{"literal":""}},{"label":"the condition is not already recorded in the review field","left":{"participant":{"name":"activation_decision","path":"components.validation_decision.review"}},"op":"ne","right":{"action_field":"condition"}}],"effects":[{"participant":"activation_decision","path":"components.validation_decision.review","op":"set","value":{"action_field":"condition"}}],"limits":["The review field is the only represented string field available for this institutional note, so recording it can replace an earlier review entry; no separate condition record exists.","The action cannot verify that the actor has an expressed supportive stance because no actor-position participant is linked to the action.","The action does not set or change the actor's stance or assent, the technical condition, or the decision's recorded assents."],"tests":["A nonempty condition and active concern at the decision's location record the condition text in the review field.","An empty condition or inactive concern report is refused.","A condition identical to the current review entry is refused rather than making a no-op change.","A concern or decision at a different location is refused."],"semantic_bindings":["validation_decision.review stores the supplied institutional condition note","active information report represents the concern source"]}],"processes":[{"process_id":"partnership-meeting-countdown","rationale":"The represented regular partnership meeting advances toward its next scheduled occurrence each round.","selector":{"categories":["regular-partnership-meeting"],"components":["moment"]},"checks":[{"label":"the meeting countdown is above zero","left":{"participant":{"name":"it","path":"components.moment.ticks_until"}},"op":"gt","right":{"literal":0}}],"effects":[{"participant":"it","path":"components.moment.ticks_until","op":"subtract","value":{"literal":1}}]},{"process_id":"partnership-meeting-recurrence","rationale":"When the represented meeting countdown reaches zero, the recurring meeting is counted and its two-round countdown starts again.","selector":{"categories":["regular-partnership-meeting"],"components":["moment"]},"checks":[{"label":"the meeting countdown has reached zero","left":{"participant":{"name":"it","path":"components.moment.ticks_until"}},"op":"eq","right":{"literal":0}}],"effects":[{"participant":"it","path":"components.moment.occurrences","op":"add","value":{"literal":1}},{"participant":"it","path":"components.moment.ticks_until","op":"set","value":{"literal":2}}]}],"terminal":null}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "The local causal compiler rejected that proposal. Compiler error: ActionDeclarationError: actor_selector names unknown components: ['location']. Return a corrected JSON object only. State paths in participant/path and effect/path fields must be copied EXACTLY from allowed_state_paths; do not abbreviate component containers (for example use portable.portable, not portable)."}]

